# Zidane, Tantalus Thief: "When Zidane enters, gain control of target creature an opponent controls until end of turn. Untap it. It gains
# lifelink and haste until end of turn." Bot1 takes Bot2's Grizzly Bears: it
# attacks Bot2 with haste and lifelink for 2, so Bot1 gains 2 (CR 702.15b). Taking it is Bot1 gaining control, which Zidane doesn't watch.
# "Whenever an opponent gains control of a permanent from you, you create a Treasure token" (CR 603.10d): when the turn ends the Bears is
# Bot2's again (CR 611.2a, 514.2), an opponent gaining control of a permanent from Bot1, and Bot1 creates one Treasure. Bot2 is not given one.

